{"title":"Footpad","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 7 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (7.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/footpad\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=6\">Lv 6 <span>36</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=7\">Lv 7 <span>21</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>21</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=6\" title=\"Pick level 6\"><td><b>6</b></td><td>22</td><td>6.2</td><td>300</td><td class=\"muted\">66 · 8.7 · 900</td><td>36</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia%20Iron%20Mine\">Binxonia Iron Mine</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=7\" title=\"Pick level 7\"><td><b>7</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>24</td><td>7.5</td><td>350</td><td class=\"muted\">72 · 10.5 · 1,050</td><td>21</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=8\" title=\"Pick level 8\"><td><b>8</b></td><td>26</td><td>8.9</td><td>400</td><td class=\"muted\">78 · 12.5 · 1,200</td><td>21</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 8 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 8 looted corpses, 10 recorded drops, 119 total, 4–15 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 6 total, 6 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 4 total, 4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"carrot-seeds\" title=\"Carrot Seeds - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/a7c4e7b0c4b8174e8138.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Carrot Seeds</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+10 more\">+10 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bandit-tunic\" title=\"Bandit Tunic - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d7826cf6366831b7b094.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit Tunic</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"fine-trousers\" title=\"Fine Trousers - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e55acc011886a033e0b5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fine Trousers</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"deerhide-legs\" title=\"Deerhide Legs - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3c471d02a376b5a951dd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deerhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-small\" title=\"Mana Potion Small - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/4b59eb7c2796b5056c1b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Small</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-small\" title=\"Stamina Potion Small - in 13% of 8 looted c