 src=\"data/img/37ca95e6a5221cd21a57.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deerhide Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1094.1px,-1003.7px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/3/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/3/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/4/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/4/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/5/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/5/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:1024px\"><i style=\"left:1150.6px;top:972.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1077.5px;top:981.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1082.1px;top:1048.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1034.1px;top:1008.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1139.8px;top:1024.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1047.7px;top:992.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1131.6px;top:998.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1107.3px;top:980.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1082.9px;top:1020.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1101.9px;top:1029.6px\"></i></div><figcaption>Rustpick Mine</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 11 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia%20Iron%20Mine\">Binxonia Iron Mine</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"footpad\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/bandit-footpad\"><img src=\"data/img/1eae4e803907596d0d60.we